{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QmhNaLCpSubqc1ZVfj1h7E","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→upstream backend {\n     2→    server ${BACKEND_HOST}:${BACKEND_PORT};\n     3→}\n     4→\n     5→server {\n     6→    listen 80;\n     7→    server_name _;\n     8→\n     9→    # Security headers\n    10→    add_header X-Frame-Options \"DENY\" always;\n    11→    add_header X-Content-Type-Options \"nosniff\" always;\n    12→    add_header Referrer-Policy \"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" always;\n    13→    add_header X-XSS-Protection \"1; mode=block\" always;\n    14→\n    15→    # Content Security Policy (report-only for initial rollout)\n    16→    add_header Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only \"default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://unpkg.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: https:; connect-src 'self' ws: wss:; frame-ancestors 'none';\" always;\n    17→\n    18→    # Gzip compression\n    19→    gzip on;\n    20→    gzip_vary on;\n    21→    gzip_min_length 1024;\n    22→    gzip_proxied any;\n    23→    gzip_types text/plain text/css text/xml text/javascript application/javascript application/json application/xml;\n    24→\n    25→    # Static files from Astro build\n    26→    location /static/ {\n    27→        alias /usr/share/nginx/html/static/;\n    28→        expires 1y;\n    29→        add_header Cache-Control \"public, immutable\";\n    30→        try_files $uri $uri/ =404;\n    31→    }\n    32→\n    33→    # Astro assets (CSS, JS bundles)\n    34→    location /_astro/ {\n    35→        alias /usr/share/nginx/html/static/_astro/;\n    36→        expires 1y;\n    37→        add_header Cache-Control \"public, immutable\";\n    38→        try_files $uri $uri/ =404;\n    39→    }\n    40→\n    41→    # Static pages (home, about, login) - served from Astro dist\n    42→    location = / {\n    43→      